    description: Some("Millipedes wind down through a garden of mushrooms while spiders, bees, beetles and earwigs work the edges, and you shoot arrows up at all of it. Mushrooms turn the millipede back, but a poisoned one sends it charging straight down at you. Shoot an inchworm and everything slows for four seconds; shoot a DDT bomb and its vapour triples what it kills."),
